rhythm echo consent cmps: the consent banners Echo knows how to click

Usage:
  rhythm echo consent cmps [--json]

Flags:
      --json                 write JSON to stdout
  -q, --quiet                only the verdict and what failed
      --plain                no color or glyphs (screen readers, logs)
      --no-color             no color

Exit codes: 0 ok, 2 usage error, 3 couldn't run.
rhythm echo consent --help lists the consent check's flags.
rhythm echo help lists every command.
